#| msgid "If conflicts arise and a strategy for automatically resolving conflicting notes (see the \"NOTES MERGE STRATEGIES\" section) is not given, the \"manual\" resolver is used. This resolver checks out the conflicting notes in a special worktree (`.git/NOTES_MERGE_WORKTREE`), and instructs the user to manually resolve the conflicts there. When done, the user can either finalize the merge with 'git notes merge --commit', or abort the merge with 'git notes merge --abort'."
msgid "If conflicts arise and a strategy for automatically resolving conflicting notes (see the \"NOTES MERGE STRATEGIES\" section) is not given, the `manual` resolver is used. This resolver checks out the conflicting notes in a special worktree (`.git/NOTES_MERGE_WORKTREE`), and instructs the user to manually resolve the conflicts there. When done, the user can either finalize the merge with `git notes merge --commit`, or abort the merge with `git notes merge --abort`."
msgstr "Caso surjam conflitos e uma estratégia para resolver automaticamente as notas conflitantes (consulte a seção \"OBSERVAÇÕES SOBRE AS ESTRATÉGIAS DE MESCLAGEM\") não sejam utilizadas, o resolvedor \"manual\" será utilizado. Este resolvedor verifica se as notas conflitantes numa árvore de trabalho especial (`.git/NOTES_MERGE_WORKTREE`) instrui o usuário a resolver manualmente os conflitos lá. Quando for concluído, o usuário pode finalizar a mesclagem com o comando 'git notes merge --commit' ou interromper a mesclagem com o comando 'git notes merge --abort'."

