#. type: Plain text
#: en/git-for-each-ref.adoc:229
#, priority:80
msgid "This is because the first-parent history of `D` has its earliest intersection with the first-parent histories of the filtered refs at a common first-parent ancestor of `B` and `C` and ties are broken by the earliest ref in the sorted order."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/git-for-each-ref.adoc:233
#, priority:80
msgid "Note that this token will not appear if the first-parent history of _<commit-ish>_ does not intersect the first-parent histories of the filtered refs."
