msgid "If `--filter=auto` is used the filter specification is determined automatically through the 'promisor-remote' protocol (see linkgit:gitprotocol-v2[5]) by combining the filter specifications advertised by the server for the promisor remotes that the client accepts (see the `promisor.acceptFromServer` configuration option in linkgit:git-config[1]). This allows the server to suggest the optimal filter for the available promisor remotes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/git-clone.adoc:205
#, priority:300
msgid "As with other filter specifications, the \"auto\" value is persisted in the configuration. This ensures that future fetches will continue to adapt to the server's current recommendation."
