msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/rev-list-options.adoc:1080
#, priority:260
msgid "The `type=<type>` shows the type of the missing object inferred from a containing object."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/rev-list-options.adoc:1085
#, priority:260
msgid "If some tips passed to the traversal are missing, they will be considered as missing too, and the traversal will ignore them. In case we cannot get their Object ID though, an error will be raised."
